/T (The fundamental problem is not food quality; Cafe Adda scores an impressive 4.29 out of 5 in food quality ratings. The problem is a systemic incapacity to convert that goodwill into a smooth, timely service experience. Specifically, the following problems have been identified and validated:)
/E (The fundamental problem is not food quality; Cafe Adda scores an impressive 4.29 out of 5 in food quality ratings. The problem is a systemic incapacity to convert that goodwill into a smooth, timely service experience. Specifically, the following problems have been identified and validated:)
