/T (Stage 5: Solution Design Philosophy Rather than proposing a single intervention, we committed to a layered approach. Physical infrastructure would break the crowd feedback loop. Signage would address the behavioural and environmental dimension. Technology would break the counter-clustering loop by decoupling the act of waiting from the act of being near the counter.)
/E (Stage 5: Solution Design Philosophy Rather than proposing a single intervention, we committed to a layered approach. Physical infrastructure would break the crowd feedback loop. Signage would address the behavioural and environmental dimension. Technology would break the counter-clustering loop by decoupling the act of waiting from the act of being near the counter.)
/Pg 16 0 R
