/T (Why This Approach Matters: The Buzzer System does not just improve convenience, it fundamentally restructures the spatial and behavioural dynamics of the cafe during peak hours. By decoupling the act of waiting from the act of being near the counter, it eliminates the single densest point of congestion in the entire service flow. Students can sit comfortably, study, or converse while their food is prepared. The counter area remains clear. Staff can work without navigating around clusters of waiting customers. The result is a quieter, faster, and more dignified service experience for everyone.)
/E (Why This Approach Matters: The Buzzer System does not just improve convenience, it fundamentally restructures the spatial and behavioural dynamics of the cafe during peak hours. By decoupling the act of waiting from the act of being near the counter, it eliminates the single densest point of congestion in the entire service flow. Students can sit comfortably, study, or converse while their food is prepared. The counter area remains clear. Staff can work without navigating around clusters of waiting customers. The result is a quieter, faster, and more dignified service experience for everyone.)
