/E (5. Admin Authentication: The admin panel is protected by a unique password known only to cafe staff. This password is not stored or displayed anywhere accessible to students, and the authentication mechanism prevents brute-force or casual access attempts. The admin interface is deliberately minimal, a single token input field, so staff can trigger notifications in seconds without interrupting their workflow.)
