/T (From the Student's Perspective: The student's journey through the Buzzer System is frictionless by design. After ordering and receiving their bill, they scan a QR code they can see right in front of them, tap one button, type one number, and put their phone in their pocket. The next interaction they have with the application is when it buzzes to tell them their food is ready. At no point are they required to create an account, download an application, read instructions, or make more than two taps.)
/E (From the Student's Perspective: The student's journey through the Buzzer System is frictionless by design. After ordering and receiving their bill, they scan a QR code they can see right in front of them, tap one button, type one number, and put their phone in their pocket. The next interaction they have with the application is when it buzzes to tell them their food is ready. At no point are they required to create an account, download an application, read instructions, or make more than two taps.)
