/P 159 0 R
/T (Signage and Behavioural Compliance: The "Please Do Not Litter" and "Please Don't Break the Line" posters produced a measurable improvement in seating area cleanliness, with informal observations noting fewer food waste incidents at tables. The "Exit on Your Left" directional signage helped alleviate counter-area congestion by providing a clear post-collection exit path, reducing the duration of counter dwell time.)
/E (Signage and Behavioural Compliance: The "Please Do Not Litter" and "Please Don't Break the Line" posters produced a measurable improvement in seating area cleanliness, with informal observations noting fewer food waste incidents at tables. The "Exit on Your Left" directional signage helped alleviate counter-area congestion by providing a clear post-collection exit path, reducing the duration of counter dwell time.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
