/Title (Cafe Adda operates as the only premium single-outlet food service within a campus ecosystem that generates highly concentrated, time-sensitive demand. Students operate under fixed academic schedules lectures, labs, and tutorials that leave very narrow windows for meals and refreshments. These windows, typically 15 to 30 minutes in duration, do not afford the luxury of long wait times.)
