/Title (Wait-Time Satisfaction vs. Food Quality Gap The data presents a stark contrast: food quality scores 4.29 out of 5, while wait-time satisfaction scores 2.66 out of 5. This gap of nearly 1.63 points on a 5-point scale represents the single largest opportunity for service improvement. Students are already sold on the food, the only barrier to a better experience is the speed and predictability of service delivery.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1326 0 R
